  dialogueID: CatNPC - Quest - OP2
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: I guess that means monsters, right?
    textPL: "Mam wra\u017Cenie, \u017Ce to oznacza potwory, prawda?"
    expressionName: scared
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7aa6b929d7ec3a4b872bb20756e679a, type: 2}
    textENG: 'Exactly. Slimes have been spotted around the area.

      Be careful.
      But if you get the pebble, it will be worth it.'
    textPL: "Dok\u0142adnie.\r\nUwa\u017Caj na siebie. Ale je\u015Bli zdob\u0119dziesz
      kamyk, naprawd\u0119 si\u0119 op\u0142aci."
    expressionName: default
  options:
  - optionTextENG: Alright.
    optionTextPL: "W porz\u0105dku."
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e32ef8e5aa4146e4f88dd1ebed234ebb, type: 2}
